      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "4\n3\n1 2 4\n3 5 6\n3\n1 2 5\n3 4 6\n4\n1 2 3 4\n6 7 5 8\n3\n1 3 5\n2 4 6",
        "output": "2\n1\n3\n0",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111:the best strategy is to steal takeout 111.\n\nMoment 222: takeout 222 arrives;\nMoment 333: person 111 arrives and takes takeout 222;\nMoment 444: takeout 333 arrives;\nMoment 555: person 222 arrives and takes takeout 333;\nMoment 666: person 333 arrives and leaves in frustration.\n\nIn this case, evil people are persons 111 and 222. It can be proved that 222 is the maximum answer."
